<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAFLIFE RAISES INTERIM SHR, NO DIV.</title>
<headline>SAFLIFE RAISES INTERIM SHR, NO DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September</p>
<p>30, 1996 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     </p>
<p>    - before exceptionals	    34.9     vs   25.0</p>
<p>    - after exceptionals	     41.0     vs   36.3</p>
<p>    Attrib income			14.42    vs   10.74</p>
<p>Income after tax before </p>
<p>    exceptional items		  24.77    vs   9.11</p>
<p>    Outside shareholder's interest 12.48    vs   1.71</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		  2.13     vs   3.35</p>
<p>Full name: Saflife Ltd (financial services)</p>
<p>NOTE - It is company policy to declare dividend at the end</p>
<p>of the financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
